@*
    _SponsorStrip.cshtml — Spec 019 FR-003 sponsor partner-logo strip.

    Renders the five sponsor SVGs vendored under wwwroot/lib/brand/sponsors/:
      - SBD (Sistema de Banca para el Desarrollo)
      - CROCUS
      - nexo
      - Programa Semilla
      - 10 años badge

    Layout: full-width <footer>, max 56 px tall, sponsors centered with
    flex-wrap so a narrow viewport (≤ 480 px) drops to two rows; if still
    tight, the 10 años badge hides via the .fl-sponsor-strip @media query
    in tokens.css. Component CSS lives in tokens.css (.fl-sponsor-strip).

    Optional model: anonymous { HideOnPrint = bool }. Pass HideOnPrint=true
    on application detail and reviewer queue / detail surfaces (research R13);
    omit / pass false on auth surfaces and the bare _Layout.

    Voice / a11y: each <img> carries an alt attribute matching the sponsor
    display name. role="contentinfo" / "complementary" is owned by the host
    page footer; this partial only declares the strip element.
*@
@{
    // Read HideOnPrint without `dynamic` — _Layout passes the parent view's
    // model through to the partial, so a typed model without `HideOnPrint`
    // would otherwise raise RuntimeBinderException. Reflection probes the
    // member safely; absent → defaults to false. Caller surfaces opt-in by
    // invoking with an anonymous `new { HideOnPrint = true }`.
    var hideOnPrint = Model?.GetType()
        .GetProperty("HideOnPrint", System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Instance | System.Reflection.BindingFlags.Public)
        ?.GetValue(Model) is bool flag && flag;
}
@* When hideOnPrint is true, Razor emits data-print-hide="sponsor-strip";
   when null/false, Razor suppresses the attribute entirely (built-in
   conditional-attribute idiom — keeps the attribute well-formed). *@
<footer class="fl-sponsor-strip"
        data-testid="sponsor-strip"
        data-print-hide="@(hideOnPrint ? "sponsor-strip" : null)"
        aria-label="Patrocinadores">
    <img src="~/lib/brand/sponsors/sbd.svg" alt="Sistema de Banca para el Desarrollo" data-sponsor="sbd" />
    <img src="~/lib/brand/sponsors/crocus.svg" alt="CROCUS" data-sponsor="crocus" />
    <img src="~/lib/brand/sponsors/nexo.svg" alt="nexo" data-sponsor="nexo" />
    <img src="~/lib/brand/sponsors/programa-semilla.svg" alt="Programa Semilla" data-sponsor="programa-semilla" />
    <img src="~/lib/brand/sponsors/10-anos.svg" alt="10 años" data-sponsor="10-anos" />
</footer>
